(6485, 'LoginStateWarnAboutRMT', 'Your account has been detected trading in-game items or progress for real money. Trading items or accounts for external currency (including currencies used on external trading forums) or real world value is not allowed and can lead to your account being banned.

We take Real Money Trading very seriously because it damages Path of Exile''s economy and undermines the fairness of the game. It''s not fair for other players who earn their progress by playing the game properly.

In this case, we have reduced your ban to a warning. We will keep an eye on your account in the future. If you have any questions about this, please contact support@grindinggear.com.', '', '', 3759311952, '', ''),
