(6535, 'RelicAltarWindowTitle', 'Relic Altar', '', '', 2290118661, '', ''),
(6536, 'RelicAltarWindowInfo', 'At the start of a your Sanctum run, you have an opportunity to place ancient Relics on this altar. These Relics influence various aspects of the Sanctum to make your run easier. Relics have varying dimensions, so arrange them carefully to maximise your benefits.

Relics are locked in for the duration of the run, and are not destroyed - they can be used in future runs.

You can unlock more Relic slots by killing bosses deeper and deeper in the Sanctum.

Spare Relics can be stored in the Relic Locker or any of your personal stash tabs.', '', '', 2229941862, '', ''),
(6537, 'HideoutMannequinStand', 'Mannequin', '', '', 1804469647, '', ''),
(6538, 'CreateCharacterStateHardcoreAndHardModeConfirmationTitle', 'Hardcore Ruthless Characters', '', '', 2111112182, '', ''),
(6539, 'CreateCharacterStateHardcoreAndHardModeConfirmationText', 'Please note that dead Hardcore characters cannot be restored for any reason (including game bugs or internet lag).

Also, Ruthless is a significantly different game experience with extreme item scarcity. Hardcore Ruthless characters that die are voided and are no longer playable.

Are you sure you want to create a Hardcore Ruthless character?', '', '', 652419123, '', ''),
