(6544, 'SanctumMapWindowInfo', 'This map shows your current progress on this floor of The Forbidden Sanctum. Your journey will take you on a path from the entrance of the floor to the boss room on the right; you can''t double backwards to enter previous rooms.

You can see a few rooms ahead, which will help you make a choice about what path to take. Your run ends if you die or run out of Resolve.

Some rooms are Afflicted, and will apply Afflictions to you when you enter them.

Manage your levels of Resolve, Aureus Coins and your Boons/Afflictions to make it through the Sanctum alive.', '', '', 1946607980, '', ''),
