(6960, 'AncestralTrialMatchSelectionInfoHover', 'The Trial of the Ancestors pits you and your team of warriors against other tribes across multiple rounds. Each team will be eliminated after losing exactly two matches. To win the tournament, your team must be the last one standing.' || char(13) || '
