(6989, 'AncestralPlanningInfoHover', 'Place your Warriors to have them fight with you in the match.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Defeated Warriors revive at their Ancestral Totem after a delay. This delay increases each time a Warrior is defeated.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Interact with opponent Ancestral Totems to Banish them. Banished Ancestral Totems cannot revive their respective Warrior. Banish all of your opponents Ancestral Totems to win the match.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
If a Warrior takes 5% of their combined Life and Energy Shield while Banishing an Ancestral Totem, they will be interrupted and be unable to take any actions for a duration.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Equipment Items can be used to improve your Warriors. Warriors and Equipment Items are retained between matches but not between tournaments.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
<colour:ancestralblue>{<bold>{Field Items}} can be placed in any available slot. They can be activated to trigger their effects. After being activated, Field Items are destroyed. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
<colour:ancestralblue>{<bold>{Attackers}} will push forward from their position, targeting enemies and Ancestral Totems in close proximity.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
<colour:ancestralblue>{<bold>{Escorts}} will prioritise following you. Enemy Warriors in the Escort position will follow their Chieftain. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
<colour:ancestralblue>{<bold>{Flankers}} will push forward, prioritising targeting enemy Ancestral Totems and are less inclined to engage in combat.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
<colour:ancestralblue>{<bold>{Defenders}} will attempt to prevent enemy Warriors from Banishing Ancestral Totems.', '', '', 456787594, '', ''),
