(7498, 'KalguurHarbourInfoHover', 'Send Shipments consisting of resources you have produced in Kingsmarch to nearby Karui and Kalguuran Ports. In exchange for the resources you send to the Ports, they will send back rewards based off the resources sent. ' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Each Shipment you prepare will have a Shipment value. The higher this value, the greater chance your Ship will suffer unforeseen circumstances on its voyage. To reduce the Risk of this happening, crew your ship with recruits adept at Shipping.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Ports have favoured resources that they value highly, and will grant a bonus to the rewards sent back for that resource. These can be filled over multiple shipments. Bars count 5 times for Port Quotas. Once fulfilled the Port will send back additional rewards and will generate a new set of favoured resources.', '', '', 924255452, '', ''),
(7499, 'KalguurShipAbandonConfirmation', 'Are you sure you want to abandon this Shipment?
