(7819, 'MercenaryEncounterWindowInfoHover', 'Mercenaries of Trarthus have arrived in Wraeclast and are searching for worthy Exiles to offer their services to.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
When encountering a Mercenary, you will be able to inspect all gear, skills and supports they have equipped. Then, you can choose to duel them for a Gold wager. If you win the duel, you keep your Gold and the Mercenary will follow you as an ally in combat for the next few areas.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
In addition, you can select a piece of gear the Mercenary has equipped, or an item from their rucksack. If you win, you get to take it for yourself!' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
In Map areas, you can also request a rematch from the Mercenary. If you win they drop a Warrant, allowing you to challenge them to a duel in a future Map. Though their skills and supports will remain the same, they will have a different set of items equipped the next time you duel them.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Finally, if you are a Scion with the Luminary Ascendancy you can choose to permanently hire the Mercenary if you win the duel.', '', '', 1745951387, '', ''),
(7820, 'MercenaryLoadoutWindowInfoHover', 'Permanently hired Mercenaries can have their equipped gear changed, but cannot have skills or supports changed. If the Mercenary you have on hand doesn''t have the skills you want, you''ll have to keep searching for another!' || char(13) || '
Similarly, hired Mercenaries can only equip items up to the level they were when you hired them. However, Mercenary passive stats and skills will scale up to the level of the current area you are in, up to a maximum of level 68. To get a higher level helping hand you''ll need to find and defeat higher level Mercenaries in Wraeclast.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Permanently hired Mercenaries can only accompany Scions with the Luminary Ascendancy class. They will not accompany you if you are too low level relative to them.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
You can also manage which of your permanently hired Mercenaries is currently accompanying you here, by using the Invite, Reserve and Dismiss buttons. Dismissed Mercenaries cannot be rehired, so be careful!', '', '', 1813957029, '', ''),
(7821, 'RecombinatorUIUseOldMethodButtonPopupTextInactive', 'Enable Unpredictable Recombination' || char(13) || '
<grey>{Unpredictable Recombination is always successful, but you cannot' || char(13) || '
select which modifiers appear on the resultant item}', '', '', 4204252771, '', ''),
(7822, 'RecombinatorUIUseOldMethodButtonPopupTextActive', 'Disable Unpredictable Recombination' || char(13) || '
<grey>{Unpredictable Recombination is always successful, but you cannot' || char(13) || '
select which modifiers appear on the resultant item}', '', '', 3444113455, '', ''),
