(7827, 'MercenaryReserveButtonHover', 'Setting a Mercenary to Reserve will have them wait for you in Town or your Hideout until you need them again.' || char(13) || '
You can have up to three total Mercenaries, with only one accompanying you at a time.', '', '', 3734748972, '', ''),
(7828, 'MercenaryDismissButton', 'Dismiss', '', '', 641277467, '', ''),
(7829, 'MercenaryDismissButtonHover', 'Dismissing a Mercenary will permanently remove them from your roster. Make sure you are certain you no longer require a Mercenary''s services before you Dismiss them!', '', '', 3958243100, '', ''),
(7830, 'MercenaryInviteButton', 'Invite', '', '', 2776529772, '', ''),
(7831, 'MercenaryInviteButtonHover', 'Invite this Mercenary to actively accompany you on your travels through Wraeclast.' || char(13) || '
Any Mercenary you currently have accompanying you will be set to Reserve.', '', '', 3579635977, '', ''),
(7832, 'MercenaryDismissWarning', 'Are you sure you want to Dismiss this Mercenary? You will not be able to re-hire them!', '', '', 2127529162, '', ''),
(7833, 'MercenaryReviveButton', 'Revive', '', '', 1523053359, '', ''),
(7834, 'MercenaryReviveButtonHover', 'Spend (<<village_gold>> {0}) to Revive this Mercenary and get them fit for combat again.', '', '', 1811375814, '', ''),
(7835, 'MercenaryAttributeInfoHover', 'Each Mercenary is associated with Attributes.' || char(13) || '
Mercenaries will generate with gear that matches the Attributes they are associated with, and will only be able to be equipped with new Armour gear that matches their Attributes in the following way:' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
For Mercenaries with a single Attribute, any Armour gear that requires that Attribute is valid.' || char(13) || '
For Mercenaries with multiple Attributes, any Armour gear that requires an Attribute not associated with that Mercenary is invalid.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
As an example:' || char(13) || '
A STR Mercenary will be equippable with gear requiring just STR, STR + DEX or STR + INT.' || char(13) || '
A DEX/INT Mercenary will be equippable with gear requiring just DEX, just INT or DEX + INT.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Mercenaries do not need to meet attribute requirements outside of above rule. Mercenaries need to be within 70% of level requirements of an item to equip it.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Mercenaries also have preferred weapon types, and will not equip weapons that do not match their preferred types.', '', '', 3076794247, '', ''),
(7836, 'MercenaryCurrentlyExiledAttributesTitle', 'Currently Exiled Mercenary Types:', '', '', 3486949060, '', ''),
