(8383, 'DeepwaterCraftingUIInfo', 'Allflame crafting is a powerful tool that can be used to magnify the efficiency of your currency.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
Place an item and a currency that is valid to apply that item into the crafting window. Assuming you can pay the cost of [DeadMansSulphur|Dead Man''s Sulphur], you will be allowed to perform the craft which the placed currency would usually do to that item. However, instead of just one outcome you will instead create multiple [GhostlyCopy|Ghostly Copies], each of which is the result of having performed the crafting step on the original item. Allflame crafting cannot be performed on corrupted items, nor can it be used to corrupt things. Additionally, Allflame crafting does not work with most item quality applying or socket manipulating currency.' || char(13) || '
' || char(13) || '
You can then choose one of these [GhostlyCopy|Ghostly Copies] to keep for yourself, effectively multiplying your currency use by the number of Copies created. Certain crafting steps will apply [Intangibility] however, which can limit the total Allflame crafting that can be done on a single item.', '', '', 400062898, '', ''),
